OL,3,GNEWSASearch for suspects after shot
OL,4,Aheard near school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting for suspects who led
OL,7,Fthem on an eight-mile (12.8km) car
OL,8,Fchase after reports of shots being
OL,9,Fheard near a school.
OL,11,FOfficers from Bedfordshire Police were
OL,12,Fcalled to Grebe Drive, Leighton
OL,13,FBuzzard, shortly before 15:30 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday with reports of a firearm
OL,15,Fbeing discharged.
OL,17,FAs a precaution, nearby Greenleas
OL,18,FSchool went into lockdown for a short
OL,19,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
