OL,3,GNEWSASearch for suspects after shot
OL,4,Aheard near school
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers identified a car, thought to
OL,7,Fbe at the scene of the incident, but it
OL,8,Ffailed to stop, prompting a chase that
OL,9,Fended when the vehicle crashed in
OL,10,FDunstable and the suspects fled on
OL,11,Ffoot.
